  clock: 3  # d0b8
  nonce: d0b8  # d0b8
  message: "Fixed in PR #3657. The yjs_crdt linker text-scans every JS/TS file for write/read patterns (.set, .observe, .on, .addBlock) that overlap generic Vue/Rails/Express vocabulary. On chatwoot (Rails+Vue, no yjs deps), 68 false-positive event_publishes edges resulted. Fix: link_yjs_crdt early-exits with empty LinkerResult unless package.json declares at least one of YJS_DEPENDENCY_NAMES = {yjs, y-protocols, y-websocket}. Real Yjs apps depend on yjs core directly (it's a runtime dep of y-monaco/y-prosemirror/y-quill/etc.), so the gate is structurally correct. +3 property tests; 38 existing tests gain a yjs dep symbol helper."  # d0b8
